Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 .../{Test.Benchmark+Assert.swift => Test.Benchmark.swift}         | 0
 ....swift => Test.Snapshot.Strategy where Format == String.swift} | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Test Benchmark/{Test.Benchmark+Assert.swift => Test.Benchmark.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Test/{Test.Snapshot.Strategy+Description.swift => Test.Snapshot.Strategy where Format == String.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Test Benchmark/Test.Benchmark+Assert.swift b/Sources/Test Benchmark/Test.Benchmark.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Test Benchmark/Test.Benchmark+Assert.swift
rename to Sources/Test Benchmark/Test.Benchmark.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Test/Test.Snapshot.Strategy+Description.swift b/Sources/Test/Test.Snapshot.Strategy where Format == String.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Test/Test.Snapshot.Strategy+Description.swift
rename to Sources/Test/Test.Snapshot.Strategy where Format == String.swift
